## Overview

This payload uses the classic **CommonsCollections6** gadget chain (works on commons-collections 3.x without requiring `InvokerTransformer` to be on a filter blacklist, unlike CC1 which needs specific `Map` classes).

```
ObjectInputStream.readObject()
  → AnnotationInvocationHandler.readObject()      [CC1/CC5/CC6 variants differ]
  → ...
```

